  "_comment": "News outlets whose headlines may appear beside the official reports, matched on the registrable domain of the <source url> an aggregator (Google News) names. Anything else is dropped before it is tagged, so an unknown content farm or press-release repost never reaches the board. Add a domain here to admit an outlet; the build reports the domains it dropped most (news.untrusted_outlets in the snapshot). Press-release wires (prnewswire, globenewswire, businesswire, einpresswire) and Yahoo Finance reposts are left out on purpose. 2026-10-22 (user review of news.untrusted_outlets): admitted editorial outlets, wires, industry bodies and research desks; still left out are reposts/aggregators (yahoo, marketscreener, commodity-board, briefs.co), market-data and SEO report sites (sunsirs, tradingview, indexbox), junior-miner promotion (investingnews, cruxinvestor), social media and directories.",
